ven after several years as an acolyte.","abilities":["Refills a nearby Fountain and heals nearby enemies when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":360,"def":100,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"peltast":{"slug":"peltast","name":"Peltast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Peltast.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Warrior played by a Minoan citizen who is well-versed in the role, able to hit the backsides of passersby with his javelin with great precision.","abilities":["Becomes melee if ranged attack misses"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":5400,"atk":450,"def":150,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"disappointed_statue":{"slug":"disappointed_statue","name":"Disappointed Statue","icon":"/enemies-icons/Disappointed Statue.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Once an ordinary sculpture found on the streets of Minos, inspired by a legendary monster who blocks roads and makes travelers answer riddles, disappointedly devouring those who fail to answer correctly. A hero from Thebes eventually solved the monster's riddle through her courage and wisdom.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Lands when passing over a Fountain without a statue","Fountains it lands on cannot be healed and continuously lose water","Leaves the battlefield after spending a certain amount of time on a Fountain"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":550,"def":800,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"tragic_poet":{"slug":"tragic_poet","name":"Tragic Poet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tragic Poet.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"An aoidos on the streets of Minos, singing stories of sorrow. Many classical plays were banned when the Sargonians invaded Minos, but the aoidoi continued to whisper the old legends, passing on the courage and spirit of the heroes. The voices of the aoidoi are stronger and more resonant when they sing of tragedies.","abilities":["Draws and absorbs water from Fountains, summoning <Heroic Spirit> when complete"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":800,"def":150,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"brave_palladulis":{"slug":"brave_palladulis","name":"Brave Palladulis","icon":"/enemies-icons/Brave Palladulis.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The hero Palladulis, played by two Minoans. They have become experts at playing Palladulis, working in perfect tandem to recreate his heroic charge. The one in front has gotten used to getting dazed from hitting walls, as the one in back cannot see what is in front of them.","abilities":["Charges if there is an ally in the direction of its movement, dealing heavy Physical damage when it hits your unit","When Immersed, charge passes through allies until hitting terrain, taking heavy True damage and becoming stunned"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":44000,"atk":1900,"def":1600,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"xanthos_the_avenger":{"slug":"xanthos_the_avenger","name":"Xanthos, the Avenger","icon":"/enemies-icons/Xanthos, the Avenger.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Come what may, he will stand before the Sargonians and his own people, with nothing to hide, and ask 